  "reusable": true,
  "title": "Pre-Vote round survives leader establishment and makes the new Leader re-elect itself",
  "cause": "A Candidate whose election timer fires starts a Pre-Vote round without dropping its running election; establish_leader clears only `candidate`, so `pre_candidate` survives; handle_pre_vote_resp then calls elect() on the established Leader and do_elect keeps the Leader object.",
  "trigger": "Candidate at term T times out (e.g. slow save_vote, or trigger().elect(true) while Candidate) and pre-votes for T+1; the delayed real vote for T arrives first (Leader at T); the granted Pre-Vote reply arrives afterwards.",
  "consequence": "The healthy term-T Leader bumps its own term to T+1 while keeping a Leader object at (T, committed); RaftCore::trigger_routine_actions -> try_leader_handler hits debug_assert leader.vote >= state.vote and the core panics (Fatal::Panicked); in release builds the Leader runs behind its persisted vote.",
  "sites": [
    "openraft/src/engine/engine_impl.rs:handle_pre_vote_resp",
    "openraft/src/engine/engine_impl.rs:establish_leader",
    "openraft/src/engine/engine_impl.rs:pre_elect",
    "openraft/src/core/raft_core.rs:handle_tick_election",
    "openraft/src/core/raft_core.rs:does_pre_candidate_vote_match"
  ],
  "actions": [
    "HandlePreVoteResponse",
    "HandleVoteResponse",
    "PreElect",
    "TickPreElect",
    "ElectEffect"
  ],
  "invariants": [
    "LeaderVoteCoversLocalVote"
  ],
  "premises": [
    "Pre-Vote is enabled (Config::enable_pre_vote or runtime pre_vote(true)) or trigger().elect(true) is called on a Candidate.",
    "The Candidate's own election is still in progress when its election timer fires: e.g. save_vote slower than the election timeout (RaftCore awaits it inline), so queued Ticks run before the vote RPCs are dispatched.",
    "The real-vote reply for term T is delivered before the granted Pre-Vote reply for T+1; both within the vote RPC ttl (election_timeout_min).",
    "No become_following (vote grant to another node, AppendEntries from another leader, role refresh) or restart clears pre_candidate in between.",
    "Debug assertions enabled for the panic consequence (tests); otherwise the stale Leader object persists."
  ],
